    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημηγορ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deliberative speaking,</i> opp.
			forensic (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικανική</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1354b28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>speech in the public assembly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.75b
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>position of a public speaker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				36b
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> esp.
				<i>popular oratory, claptrap,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				162d
			</span></i>.</div>
